   "head": "The MTA figure falls between the tracker's two measures",
   "text": "On the typical local route, moving-only speed reads 6% faster than the MTA, and speed with stops reads 7% slower. B41: 6.6 mph with stops, 7.7 moving, 6.9 MTA; M15+: 7.5 mph with stops, 8.6 moving, 7.8 MTA; BX19: 5.5 mph with stops, 6.6 moving, 5.6 MTA.",
